    "confidence": 0.89,
    "created_at": "2026-01-14T10:22:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-14T10:23:10Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZC9R3M8T2H6Q0D4K7V1LE2",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9Y2Q4F7K3M8T1D6R0H5V9AZ",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J4W8Q9R2T6H3K7M1N5P0V8ZA",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01J9A0H7W8Q5M2R1T6K3V9N0BP",
    "speaker_id": "spk_0",
    "start_ms": 24680,
    "end_ms": 31940,
    "text": "Got it—I’ll send the latest SOC 2 Type II and confirm our retention defaults are 30 days with configurable policies.",
    "ordinal": 14,
    "confidence": 0.94,
    "created_at": "2026-01-14T10:22:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-14T10:23:11Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCA7P1H6M0T9Q3K5V8ZA3",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9Y2Q4F7K3M8T1D6R0H5V9AZ",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J4W8Q9R2T6H3K7M1N5P0V8ZA",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01J9A0H7W8Q5M2R1T6K3V9N0BP",
    "speaker_id": "spk_1",
    "start_ms": 32010,
    "end_ms": 39220,
    "text": "If you can also confirm SSO via Okta and SCIM provisioning, that will help our IT sign off faster.",
    "ordinal": 15,
    "confidence": 0.87,
    "created_at": "2026-01-14T10:22:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-14T10:23:12Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCAD4D7H2Q8M1K6R3V4LE",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9Y2Q4F7K3M8T1D6R0H5V9AZ",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J4W8Q9R2T6H3K7M1N5P0V8ZA",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01J9A0H7W8Q5M2R1T6K3V9N0BP",
    "speaker_id": "spk_0",
    "start_ms": 39240,
    "end_ms": 45210,
    "text": "Yes, we support Okta SAML and SCIM 2.0; I can loop in our solutions engineer for the exact attribute map.",
    "ordinal": 16,
    "confidence": 0.93,
    "created_at": "2026-01-14T10:22:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-14T10:23:12Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCB0Q8D2H6M0T7K3R5V9H3K",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9Y7M1P3H6Q8T0D2K5R9V4LE",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J4Z1M7C9P2D6R8T0H3K5V1QF",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JB3Q5M1H9T2V7C6K8R0D4YZA",
    "speaker_id": "spk_0",
    "start_ms": 6050,
    "end_ms": 11420,
    "text": "Before we dive in, can you share what prompted the evaluation—cost, accuracy, or speed for the ops team?",
    "ordinal": 6,
    "confidence": 0.9,
    "created_at": "2026-02-03T16:11:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-03T16:11:30Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCB9H1M6T2Q9D3K0R4V5N9QF",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9Y7M1P3H6Q8T0D2K5R9V4LE",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J4Z1M7C9P2D6R8T0H3K5V1QF",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JB3Q5M1H9T2V7C6K8R0D4YZA",
    "speaker_id": "spk_2",
    "start_ms": 11460,
    "end_ms": 18330,
    "text": "Mostly accuracy—we’re getting too many false positives in alerts, and analysts spend hours triaging noise.",
    "ordinal": 7,
    "confidence": 0.86,
    "created_at": "2026-02-03T16:11:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-03T16:11:31Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCBE6M1Q8D3H7K0R4V5N9QF",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9Y7M1P3H6Q8T0D2K5R9V4LE",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J4Z1M7C9P2D6R8T0H3K5V1QF",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JB3Q5M1H9T2V7C6K8R0D4YZA",
    "speaker_id": "spk_0",
    "start_ms": 18410,
    "end_ms": 25580,
    "text": "That makes sense—how are you measuring precision today, and do you have a labeled set we can test against?",
    "ordinal": 8,
    "confidence": null,
    "created_at": "2026-02-03T16:11:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-03T16:11:33Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCBK3D7H2Q6M1T9K4R5V8ZA",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9Y7M1P3H6Q8T0D2K5R9V4LE",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J4Z1M7C9P2D6R8T0H3K5V1QF",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JB3Q5M1H9T2V7C6K8R0D4YZA",
    "speaker_id": "spk_2",
    "start_ms": 25640,
    "end_ms": 33310,
    "text": "We have six months of cases in Jira; I can export the resolved incidents and the final disposition labels.",
    "ordinal": 9,
    "confidence": 0.83,
    "created_at": "2026-02-03T16:11:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-03T16:11:33Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCC2P6H1Q8M4T7K3R0V9H3K",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9Z0C8T2M5H7Q1D9K3R6V0BP",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J3Y8V2K7H5Q1D9M0R6T3P8NV",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JDR2T9X5N7B1K6M3Q8H0V4LE",
    "speaker_id": "spk_1",
    "start_ms": 42190,
    "end_ms": 49640,
    "text": "On pricing, we’re thinking 25 seats to start, but procurement needs a not-to-exceed number for the PO.",
    "ordinal": 41,
    "confidence": 0.88,
    "created_at": "2026-03-18T09:03:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-18T09:04:27Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCC8T1V5N0H3K2D6A4M8T",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9Z0C8T2M5H7Q1D9K3R6V0BP",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J3Y8V2K7H5Q1D9M0R6T3P8NV",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JDR2T9X5N7B1K6M3Q8H0V4LE",
    "speaker_id": "spk_0",
    "start_ms": 49710,
    "end_ms": 56620,
    "text": "If we scope it to 25 users with annual billing, ballpark is 42k; I’ll send an official quote with options.",
    "ordinal": 42,
    "confidence": 0.91,
    "created_at": "2026-03-18T09:03:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-18T09:04:28Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCCD9K0R4V5N9QF1M6T2Q",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9Z0C8T2M5H7Q1D9K3R6V0BP",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J3Y8V2K7H5Q1D9M0R6T3P8NV",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JDR2T9X5N7B1K6M3Q8H0V4LE",
    "speaker_id": "spk_1",
    "start_ms": 56670,
    "end_ms": 62110,
    "text": "Can you include a clause for quarterly true-up and the option to add contractor licenses?",
    "ordinal": 43,
    "confidence": 0.84,
    "created_at": "2026-03-18T09:03:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-18T09:04:29Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCD0D2H6M0T8Q1K3V7N9QF",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9XW8R4D2H6M0T8Q1K3V7N9QF",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J40K6D2P9S7H1M5T8Q3V0RBD",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01J8VZ1KQ3G2M7N4F6T9H2C1XA",
    "speaker_id": "spk_0",
    "start_ms": 8450,
    "end_ms": 13260,
    "text": "We saw the integration error on Salesforce—are you using a restricted profile or custom OAuth policies?",
    "ordinal": 9,
    "confidence": 0.9,
    "created_at": "2026-04-07T18:44:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-07T18:44:46Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCD5R9V4LE7H3T6Q1D9M",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9XW8R4D2H6M0T8Q1K3V7N9QF",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J40K6D2P9S7H1M5T8Q3V0RBD",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01J8VZ1KQ3G2M7N4F6T9H2C1XA",
    "speaker_id": "spk_3",
    "start_ms": 13310,
    "end_ms": 19580,
    "text": "It’s a restricted profile; our security team blocks “modify all” so the token can’t read Opportunity fields.",
    "ordinal": 10,
    "confidence": 0.78,
    "created_at": "2026-04-07T18:44:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-07T18:44:47Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCDB6H1Q8T3M7D0K4R2V9H",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9XW8R4D2H6M0T8Q1K3V7N9QF",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J40K6D2P9S7H1M5T8Q3V0RBD",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01J8VZ1KQ3G2M7N4F6T9H2C1XA",
    "speaker_id": "spk_0",
    "start_ms": 19630,
    "end_ms": 25240,
    "text": "No problem—if you grant read on Opportunity, Account, and Contact plus API Enabled, the connector should pass.",
    "ordinal": 11,
    "confidence": 0.88,
    "created_at": "2026-04-07T18:44:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-07T18:44:47Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCE2M2D6H9Q1T3K5R0V8ZA",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9YB6H1Q8T3M7D0K4R2V9H3KU",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J4F2X9M6T1Q8H3D7K0P5N2VS",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JCJ7P9R2D6A4M8T1V5N0H3KU",
    "speaker_id": "spk_2",
    "start_ms": 71200,
    "end_ms": 76610,
    "text": "We’ll need the DPA signed before we can move any production data through the pipeline.",
    "ordinal": 71,
    "confidence": 0.85,
    "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:18:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-22T07:18:36Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCE8T0K3R5V9N0BP4D7H",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9YB6H1Q8T3M7D0K4R2V9H3KU",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J4F2X9M6T1Q8H3D7K0P5N2VS",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JCJ7P9R2D6A4M8T1V5N0H3KU",
    "speaker_id": "spk_0",
    "start_ms": 76680,
    "end_ms": 82990,
    "text": "Understood—our standard DPA is based on the SCCs; I can route it to your counsel today for redlines.",
    "ordinal": 72,
    "confidence": 0.9,
    "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:18:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-22T07:18:37Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCEF3T6Q1D9M2K5R0V4LE",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9YB6H1Q8T3M7D0K4R2V9H3KU",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J4F2X9M6T1Q8H3D7K0P5N2VS",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JCJ7P9R2D6A4M8T1V5N0H3KU",
    "speaker_id": "spk_2",
    "start_ms": 83020,
    "end_ms": 88930,
    "text": "Great—also confirm where sub-processors are listed and how often that page is updated.",
    "ordinal": 73,
    "confidence": null,
    "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:18:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-22T07:18:38Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCF1D6M8T2H7Q0K3R5V9N0B",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9Z4P7M2D6H9Q1T3K5R0V8ZA",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J2X7C1R9H4M6Q8T0D3K5P7KU",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JD6M0K4Y8H2C7W1Q9P3R5TNV",
    "speaker_id": "spk_1",
    "start_ms": 28110,
    "end_ms": 33570,
    "text": "To be clear, we’re not looking for more dashboards—we need automated summaries pushed into Slack after calls.",
    "ordinal": 27,
    "confidence": 0.82,
    "created_at": "2026-06-11T21:05:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-11T21:05:42Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCF6Q8T0H3K5V1QF9C2P",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9Z4P7M2D6H9Q1T3K5R0V8ZA",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J2X7C1R9H4M6Q8T0D3K5P7KU",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JD6M0K4Y8H2C7W1Q9P3R5TNV",
    "speaker_id": "spk_0",
    "start_ms": 33620,
    "end_ms": 40190,
    "text": "We can do that—post-call, we generate a recap with action items and send it to a Slack webhook per channel.",
    "ordinal": 28,
    "confidence": 0.9,
    "created_at": "2026-06-11T21:05:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-11T21:05:43Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCFC8T2M5H7Q1D9K3R6V0B",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9Z4P7M2D6H9Q1T3K5R0V8ZA",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J2X7C1R9H4M6Q8T0D3K5P7KU",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JD6M0K4Y8H2C7W1Q9P3R5TNV",
    "speaker_id": "spk_1",
    "start_ms": 40240,
    "end_ms": 46180,
    "text": "Perfect—if you can include timestamps and the main objections, that’s exactly what our reps want.",
    "ordinal": 29,
    "confidence": 0.85,
    "created_at": "2026-06-11T21:05:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-11T21:05:44Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCG0C8T2M5H7Q1D9K3R6V0B",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9XQ1D6M8T2H7Q0K3R5V9N0BP",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J34B9T6Q2H7M1D8P5R0K3X1LE",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JEH4V1P6S9D2R7K5M0X8Q3AZ",
    "speaker_id": "spk_0",
    "start_ms": 990,
    "end_ms": 5120,
    "text": "Quick intro—this is the QBR for North America; we’ll cover adoption, pipeline influence, and next quarter goals.",
    "ordinal": 1,
    "confidence": 0.93,
    "created_at": "2026-02-26T14:52:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-26T14:52:25Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCG6H9T2V7C6K8R0D4YZA1",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9XQ1D6M8T2H7Q0K3R5V9N0BP",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J34B9T6Q2H7M1D8P5R0K3X1LE",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JEH4V1P6S9D2R7K5M0X8Q3AZ",
    "speaker_id": "spk_4",
    "start_ms": 5170,
    "end_ms": 10610,
    "text": "Sounds good—our main concern is ramp time; new reps aren’t logging calls consistently in the first 30 days.",
    "ordinal": 2,
    "confidence": 0.8,
    "created_at": "2026-02-26T14:52:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-26T14:52:26Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCGC0P7W3R5K2N8F6X1L4V",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9XQ1D6M8T2H7Q0K3R5V9N0BP",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J34B9T6Q2H7M1D8P5R0K3X1LE",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JEH4V1P6S9D2R7K5M0X8Q3AZ",
    "speaker_id": "spk_0",
    "start_ms": 10650,
    "end_ms": 15480,
    "text": "We can enable automatic dialer capture and weekly nudges; also, we’ll share a playbook for first-week templates.",
    "ordinal": 3,
    "confidence": 0.91,
    "created_at": "2026-02-26T14:52:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-26T14:52:27Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCH0T5D7H2Q8M1K6R3V4LE",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9YH0T5D7H2Q8M1K6R3V4LE",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J3Q0H5D8M2T7Q9K1R6P4N0AZ",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JAJ9C0P7W3R5K2N8F6X1L4VS",
    "speaker_id": "spk_1",
    "start_ms": 155400,
    "end_ms": 161020,
    "text": "If we miss the July 1 cutover, we’ll have to extend the legacy contract month-to-month at a premium.",
    "ordinal": 152,
    "confidence": 0.79,
    "created_at": "2026-06-27T12:09:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-27T12:10:02Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCH6Q3G2M7N4F6T9H2C1XA",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9YG5P8H1Q6M2T9D3K0V7N9QF",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J3N6R1Y8P2H5T9M0D4K7Q3CE",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JF1C8Q3H7W5T9N2M6V0K4RBD",
    "speaker_id": "spk_0",
    "start_ms": 22930,
    "end_ms": 28610,
    "text": "On the POC, let’s validate two flows: inbound lead routing and meeting notes syncing back to HubSpot.",
    "ordinal": 19,
    "confidence": 0.92,
    "created_at": "2026-01-29T08:33:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-29T08:33:29Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCHC7M3H5S0N9QF4Y8P1C",
    "transcript_id": "gong_trx_01J9YG5P8H1Q6M2T9D3K0V7N9QF",
    "call_id": "gong_call_01J3N6R1Y8P2H5T9M0D4K7Q3CE",
    "workspace_id": "gong_ws_01JF1C8Q3H7W5T9N2M6V0K4RBD",
    "speaker_id": "spk_1",
    "start_ms": 28670,
    "end_ms": 35120,
    "text": "Agreed—also include dedupe rules; we’ve had issues where contacts get overwritten when emails mismatch.",
    "ordinal": 20,
    "confidence": 0.84,
    "created_at": "2026-01-29T08:33:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-29T08:33:30Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "gong_snt_01J9ZCJ1V4Q8D2H6M0T7K3R5V9H",
